 human genome by the ENCODE pilot project</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2007</year><volume>447</volume><fpage>799</fpage><lpage>816</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17571346</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDP010C10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gardiner</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Costa</surname><given-names>A.C.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The proteins of human chromosome 21</article-title><source>Am. J. Med. Genet. C Semin. Med. Genet.</source><year>2006</year><volume>142C</volume><fpage>196</fpage><lpage>205</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17048356</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDP010C11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kuhn</surname><given-names>D.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nuovo</surname><given-names>G.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>M.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Malana</surname><given-names>G.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Pleister</surname><given-names>A.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Jiang</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmittgen</surname><given-names>T.D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Terry</surname><given-names>A.V.</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Gardiner</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Head</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Human chromosome 21-derived miRNAs are overexpressed in Down syndrome brains and hearts</article-title><source>Biochem. Biophys. Res. Commun.</source><year>2008</year><volume>370</volume><fpage>473</fpage><lpage>477</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18387358</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDP010C12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>S